// ---------------- T&D runs (ADDED 2026-11-12, John: T&D is the master source)
// A survey at MD s was taken with the bit at (ORIGINAL tally MD + sensor offset); the run used is the T&D run with
// "T&D" ticked whose bit-MD range contains that depth (deepest start wins if two overlap; shallower than the first
// run -> the first run), exactly the rule of the T&D Hookload calculation (tdModel.js tdComputeHookloadPlan). Its
