  JFD: 'Johancsik, Friesen &amp; Dawson (1984), "Torque and Drag in Directional Wells — Prediction and Measurement", SPE-11380 <em>(MTX AC / K&amp;M HERDIT Course / SPE Papers / SPE-11380-PA.pdf)</em>',
  EB: 'ISCWSA eBook (2017), ch.15 "Correcting for Pipe and Wireline Stretch" (§15.1 forces on the drillpipe, §15.2 thermal effects) and the thermal correction relationship on p.103 <em>(MTX AC / eBook_V9_10_2017-redux.pdf)</em>',
  BOU: 'Bourgoyne et al., Applied Drilling Engineering, Ch. 8 — minimum curvature <em>(MTX AC / Chapters / 08_Directional_Drilling_and_Deviation_Control.pdf)</em>',
  HOOKE: 'Axial strain of an elastic bar, ΔL = F·L/(E·A) (Hooke\'s law) <em>(textbook — not in folder)</em>',
  SM: 'MTX implementation: <code>public/js/stretchModel.js</code>',
  TD: 'MTX implementation: <code>public/js/tdModel.js</code> (the Torque &amp; Drag modeler\'s soft-string code and its hole-section / BHA-run setup)',
